Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `$limit` is not a name
  --> tests/ui/fact_root_unknown.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print($limit)
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: Jet program source has no `$` words; only config surfaces read `$NAME` from the environment
 Fix: Write the name without the `$`
